1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 6=

4
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,840
I fell into a trap.

5
00:01:44,510 --> 00:01:46,040
The air here is foul and stagnant,

6
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:49,480
and the water
is full of venomous creatures.

7
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,510
No.

8
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,040
I can't stay here.

9
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:55,400
I need to find a way out quickly.

10
00:01:58,510 --> 00:01:59,640
Is there some kind of mechanism?

11
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,680
Help.

12
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:10,710
Help!

13
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,310
Help!

14
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,080
No sign of her.

15
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,360
You useless servants!

16
00:02:16,430 --> 00:02:17,560
What good are any of you?

17
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,470
Your Highness,

18
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:23,000
Xiaoyuan has always been well-behaved.

19
00:02:23,190 --> 00:02:24,520
She wouldn't leave without a reason.

20
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,710
Something must have happened.

21
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:28,080
Let's search the temple.

22
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,680
The royal party's arrival and departure

23
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,800
were set for auspicious times
by the Taoist priest.

24
00:02:34,190 --> 00:02:35,560
What Your Highness is proposing

25
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:37,190
may not be appropriate.

26
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:37,960
Yu Feilin.

27
00:02:38,430 --> 00:02:39,520
When I'm speaking,

28
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,800
who gave you the right to interrupt?

29
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,030
Yes.

30
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,430
Your Highness.

31
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:45,400
We came here to pray
for peace and safety.

32
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:46,680
If something were to happen,

33
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,710
it would defeat the whole purpose.

34
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,000
Search the temple.

35
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,000
Yes.

36
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,150
Your Highness.

37
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:58,680
Your Highness.

38
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,000
We've already searched

39
00:03:00,270 --> 00:03:01,520
every corner to the south and east,

40
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:02,800
along with all the halls.

41
00:03:03,470 --> 00:03:04,150
There's no sign of her.

42
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:05,710
Nothing on the west side either.

43
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,310
I wonder
how my seventh brother is doing.

44
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,710
If they keep searching,
they'll reach this place soon.

45
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:16,840
I wonder if He Xiaoyuan is dead by now.

46
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:19,100
(Matchmaker Hall)

47
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:19,910
He Xiaoyuan.

48
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:22,520
He Xiaoyuan!

49
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,080
He Xiaoyuan!

50
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,630
He Xiaoyuan!

51
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:42,680
He Xiaoyuan!

52
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,520
Zhao Boqing.

53
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:47,470
Zhao Boqing.

54
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,840
Zhao Boqing.

55
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,870
Help.

56
00:03:54,470 --> 00:03:55,280
He Xiaoyuan!

57
00:03:58,590 --> 00:03:59,400
He Xiaoyuan!

58
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,270
Zhao Boqing!

59
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,310
I'm here!

60
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,720
He Xiaoyuan!

61
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:36,740
He Xiaoyuan!

62
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:38,000
He Xiaoyuan!

63
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:41,720
There's miasma here.

64
00:04:42,770 --> 00:04:48,710
♪One thought of those years,
both a dream and yet so real♪

65
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:55,520
♪One thought waits for the snow,
shining bright in my memories♪

66
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,120
He Xiaoyuan!

67
00:04:57,190 --> 00:04:57,920
He Xiaoyuan!

68
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,120
He Xiaoyuan!

69
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:00,630
You can't die!

70
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:09,420
♪Can I still hope
that someday we'll meet again?♪

71
00:05:10,550 --> 00:05:16,770
♪One thought of those years,
both a dream and yet so real♪

72
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:22,890
♪One thought waits for the snow,
shining bright in my memories♪

73
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,800
What's going on?

74
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,750
The Pleiades and its companion star

75
00:05:27,430 --> 00:05:28,190
are still...

76
00:05:30,450 --> 00:05:37,160
♪Can I still hope
that someday we'll meet again?♪

77
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:39,920
You're awake.

78
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,310
I...

79
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,750
I didn't mean it that way.

80
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:45,630
I... I know.

81
00:05:46,190 --> 00:05:48,430
Your... Your Highness
was trying to save me.

82
00:05:51,310 --> 00:05:51,800
Your Highness.

83
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,050
This hall haven't been searched.

84
00:05:58,750 --> 00:05:59,240
I...

85
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,630
Your Highness, over here.

86
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,430
He Xiaoyuan!

87
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:09,070
Boqing.

88
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,600
(How could this be?)

89
00:06:10,750 --> 00:06:12,630
(Whether it was Zhao Boqing helping her
at the flower-viewing banquet)

90
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,160
(or risking everything
to save her in the cellar this time,)

91
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:17,560
(their relationship
is clearly far from simple.)

92
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:18,800
(He Xiaoyuan.)

93
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,120
(So you're not merely)

94
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:22,480
(a servant girl trying to ingratiate
yourself with the Crown Prince.)

95
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,040
(The person truly behind you)

96
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,310
(is Zhao Boqing.)

97
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,240
Boqing.

98
00:06:26,390 --> 00:06:27,240
What happened here?

99
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,600
Thank you
for your concern, Your Highness.

100
00:06:30,430 --> 00:06:32,160
Someone falsely claimed
the Princess had summoned me

101
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,560
and led me to the Matchmaker Shrine.

102
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,950
Then that person

103
00:06:34,950 --> 00:06:36,680
pushed me into the cellar from behind.

104
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,000
Fortunately, the Seventh Prince found me

105
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,310
and rescued me in time.

106
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,560
During a royal procession
for a blessing ceremony,

107
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,390
someone actually
dared commit such a vicious act.

108
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,040
This is outrageous.

109
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,190
Xiaoyuan.

110
00:06:47,950 --> 00:06:48,920
Did you get a good look

111
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,750
at the person who pushed you?

112
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:08,580
(Wenhua Hall)

113
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:10,950
No need for formalities.

114
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:15,950
Are you feeling better?

115
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,600
Your Highness.

116
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:19,920
I'm really fine now.

117
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:22,920
It's not proper for me to stay
in the Eastern Palace to recover.

118
00:07:23,070 --> 00:07:23,750
Look.

119
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:25,600
I'm perfectly fine now.

120
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:28,000
Please let me go home to recover.

121
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:30,270
At least finish your medicine first.

122
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,430
Yesterday, you said

123
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,800
you saw the hem of a woman's skirt,

124
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,430
so you concluded

125
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,750
the person who pushed you was a woman.

126
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,870
Perhaps you
haven't heard, Miss Xiaoyuan.

127
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,160
There have always been

128
00:07:41,390 --> 00:07:43,830
plenty of women vying
for His Highness's affection

129
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,310
in and around the palace.

130
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:48,720
It must have been
His Highness's impulsive actions

131
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,750
at the flower-viewing banquet

132
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,190
that dragged you into this

133
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,630
and made you enemies.

134
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,270
Well...

135
00:07:59,310 --> 00:08:01,240
I was simply careless.

136
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,040
Please don't blame yourself,
Your Highness.

137
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,000
Xiaoyuan.

138
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,310
Don't worry.

139
00:08:06,630 --> 00:08:07,870
I will get to the bottom of this

140
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:08,750
and give you an explanation.

141
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,120
Finish your medicine first.

142
00:08:10,210 --> 00:08:11,170
I have other matters to attend to.

143
00:08:11,270 --> 00:08:12,750
We'll discuss the zither another day.

144
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:14,830
Shen Zhuguang.

145
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,000
Come here.

146
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:16,830
Come here!

147
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:30,920
Your Highness.

148
00:08:32,390 --> 00:08:33,550
What brings you here?

149
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:36,030
In front of Zhao Junyao,

150
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,960
you were bursting with energy,

151
00:08:38,270 --> 00:08:40,550
loud enough and strong enough
to take down a tiger.

152
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,080
Does that seem right?

153
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,670
What's wrong with it?

154
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,750
Even a fool can see

155
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,720
that Zhao Junyao
likes gentle, demure women.

156
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:52,390
You're so slow on the uptake.

157
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,510
No wonder you failed
all thirty-three lifetimes.

158
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:57,080
You need to learn

159
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,790
to be

160
00:09:01,450 --> 00:09:02,940
a little more "tea."
[*"Tea": slang for feigning innocence]

161
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,670
Tea?

162
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:08,750
Tea?

163
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,120
Not that kind of tea.

164
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:18,720
The "tea" arts manual for women
who know how to act cute.

165
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,960
It was written
by an eccentric outside the palace.

166
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:22,840
I hear

167
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,080
it's already all the rage
among women outside the palace.

168
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:27,200
Right.

169
00:09:28,670 --> 00:09:29,720
The author also wrote an entire series.

170
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:36,320
The strong heroine's
playbook for taming men.

171
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:39,440
A forbidden love guide
to irresistible attraction.

172
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:42,870
A guide to winning hearts
with lavish affection.

173
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:46,600
A rival's guide to winning his heart.

174
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,670
I carefully selected
all of these for you.

175
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,440
But

176
00:09:52,750 --> 00:09:54,220
I think this one,

177
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:55,460
("Tea" Arts Manual)
suits you best.

178
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:57,630
Take it home

179
00:09:57,870 --> 00:09:59,200
and study it carefully.

180
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:00,320
Also,

181
00:10:00,750 --> 00:10:02,790
the Crown Prince wants
to discuss zither music with you.

182
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,360
Once you return home,

183
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,320
you must keep practicing.

184
00:10:05,510 --> 00:10:07,480
I'll teach you a few pieces
when the time comes.

185
00:10:07,550 --> 00:10:09,080
Make sure you
learn them well. Understood?

186
00:10:14,790 --> 00:10:15,510
Finish your medicine.

187
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:38,860
(Yongning Palace)

188
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,510
Your Highness

189
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:53,910
summoned me here alone.

190
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,360
May I ask why?

191
00:10:57,530 --> 00:10:59,060
You were behind what happened
to He Xiaoyuan in the cellar,

192
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,790
weren't you?

193
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:02,600
Yu Feilin.

194
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,080
Your Highness,

195
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:06,440
please don't let your impatience

196
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:08,360
lead you to accuse me

197
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:10,480
of something I didn't do.

198
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,440
Such baseless accusations,

199
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,440
if word were to get out,

200
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:17,080
could damage Your Highness's reputation.

201
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,120
Besides,

202
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:22,390
I may become your sister-in-law one day.

203
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,910
As sisters-in-law,

204
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,270
we shouldn't distrust each other.

205
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:28,720
Don't think I don't know.

206
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:31,550
You saw how much Crown Prince
cares about Xiaoyuan,

207
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:32,750
and you became jealous.

208
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,670
I know exactly what underhanded things

209
00:11:34,870 --> 00:11:35,960
you're capable of.

210
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,120
You'd better be careful.

211
00:11:38,910 --> 00:11:40,720
Don't let me catch you doing anything.

212
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:44,670
I know He Xiaoyuan
is Your Highness's study companion.

213
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,790
Naturally, you would take her side.

214
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:49,030
But Your Highness,

215
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,840
as a member of the imperial family,

216
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,440
you should understand

217
00:11:52,870 --> 00:11:54,630
the importance
of being well matched in status.

218
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,270
He Xiaoyuan

219
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,670
has no standing to speak of.

220
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,080
Only I,

221
00:11:59,550 --> 00:12:01,240
the daughter of the Grand Tutor,

222
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,440
can truly be of help
to the Crown Prince.

223
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:05,120
You and I

224
00:12:05,670 --> 00:12:07,390
should never have been enemies.

225
00:12:12,460 --> 00:12:14,580
(Yongning Palace)

226
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:24,960
I'm furious!

227
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,510
I got so worked up

228
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:29,000
that I even have sores in my mouth.

229
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:30,440
Your Highness,

230
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:31,630
the Imperial Kitchen

231
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:32,870
sent over your favorite pastries.

232
00:12:34,150 --> 00:12:34,790
I don't want them.

233
00:12:34,790 --> 00:12:35,600
Take them away.

234
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,670
Your Highness,
are you still feeling unwell?

235
00:12:38,670 --> 00:12:39,670
Then take a look at this.

236
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:42,260
(Watermelon Frost)

237
00:12:47,910 --> 00:12:49,840
Where did you get something this good?

238
00:12:50,030 --> 00:12:50,670
Your Highness,

239
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,240
Mr. Fu Yang sent it to you.

240
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:54,120
He heard you've been unwell lately

241
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,630
and wanted to see how you were doing.

242
00:13:01,220 --> 00:13:04,940
(Watermelon Frost)

243
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:13,630
Your Highness,

244
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:16,200
this medicine smells so bitter.

245
00:13:17,150 --> 00:13:18,750
Do I really have to drink it?

246
00:13:19,510 --> 00:13:20,510
Yes.

247
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,120
Crown Prince said

248
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:24,000
the cellar had fallen
into disrepair over the years,

249
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,480
and the air inside
was foul and stagnant.

250
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:27,080
You were also trapped there
for a long time,

251
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,030
so you need plenty of sunlight

252
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:30,000
and careful nursing

253
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,550
to avoid any lingering illness.

254
00:13:32,510 --> 00:13:33,550
Yuan Yuan,

255
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:35,870
you can't let my Seventh Brother's
rescue go to waste.

256
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:37,440
He's

257
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,600
good at killing people,

258
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,600
but saving a life?

259
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:41,600
That's a rare thing for him.

260
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:43,510
So

261
00:13:43,790 --> 00:13:45,200
you have to get better soon.

262
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,240
Drink up.

263
00:13:47,790 --> 00:13:48,910
All right.

264
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:53,670
By the way,

265
00:13:53,930 --> 00:13:54,600
did you leave this

266
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,710
("Tea" Arts Manual)
at the Women's Academy?

267
00:13:59,550 --> 00:13:59,910
This...

268
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:01,840
This is...

269
00:14:04,460 --> 00:14:06,660
("Tea" Arts Manual)

270
00:14:09,420 --> 00:14:11,300
("Tea" Arts Manual)

271
00:14:21,940 --> 00:14:24,250
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

272
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,290
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

273
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:29,930
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

274
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:34,770
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

275
00:14:34,770 --> 00:14:37,510
♪My heart has long known♪

276
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:39,950
♪We made a promise long ago♪

277
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:41,900
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

278
00:14:42,570 --> 00:14:45,890
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

279
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:49,050
♪How much must I let go♪

280
00:14:49,370 --> 00:14:51,050
